      "id": "summary",
      "proposition": {
        "predicate": "summary",
        "object": "<p>Ensuring fair compensation for those affected by legacies of enslavement and measures to address debt burdens, part of 18-point strategic roadmap</p><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/news/ng-interactive/2023/mar/31/more-than-money-the-logic-of-slavery-reparations\">More than money: the logic of slavery reparations</a></p><p>A global framework for reparatory justice has been adopted at a conference in Ghana.</p><p>Heads of state and government and other officials formally approved the strategy on Friday at a gathering in a hotel in the capital, Accra, which was the first major meeting since the adoption of the landmark United Nations (UN) resolution declaring the trafficking of enslaved Africans as the gravest crime against humanity.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/news/2026/jun/19/global-framework-reparations-justice-adopted-at-landmark-conference-in-accra-ghana\">Continue reading...</a>"
